        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rqAGnLYXoNMV6mmQoyJLrkT3hVQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261266-garlic-mashed-potato-casserole-DDMFS-step-01-004f80404c144d38909a4b0b40bb9c2b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261266/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes in a large pot and cover with lightly salted water. Bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes. Drain and return to pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4Gihw4gcMTUykTFRVWIP5L8rUds=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261266-garlic-mashed-potato-casserole-DDMFS-step-02-6183a3e3e1804735b400ac989e3e64ca.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261266/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a glass baking dish. Combine milk, cream cheese, ⅓ cup green onions, butter, egg, garlic, and salt in a bowl; add to potatoes. Mash until smooth; transfer to the prepared baking dish. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and remaining green onions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
