        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xkHqp1UduILmKRIOTkatTIZnITY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261266-garlic-mashed-potato-casserole-DDMFS-step-03-11b7ab37852548eca5c059eeec2a17b0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261266/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until lightly browned, about 40 minutes.",
